WEBVTT

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:33.754
His influence towers above that of all 
other psychologists in the public eye.

00:00:33.754 --> 00:00:37.204
But was Sigmund Freud 
right about human nature?

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:39.984
And were his methods scientific?

00:00:39.984 --> 00:00:44.615
Order, order. 
Today on the stand we have… Dad?

00:00:44.615 --> 00:00:46.820
Ahem, no, your honor.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.650
This is Doctor Sigmund Freud,

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:52.380
one of the most innovative thinkers
in the history of psychology.

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:56.324
An egomaniac who propagated 
pseudoscientific theories.

00:00:56.324 --> 00:00:57.832
Well, which is it?

00:00:57.832 --> 00:01:01.292
He tackled issues medicine 
refused to address.